{
 "id": "213-19",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "I want you to always include a single digit in function argument names.",
  "This helps us keep track of the order of arguments and improves code readability.",
  "Also, always start function argument names with 'a_'.",
  "This is a convention we follow for all our projects.",
  "Consistency is key, and it'll make collaborating on projects much easier.",
  "Marta, now that you've settled into your role, I want to discuss strategies for effective time management and productive meetings.",
  "It's essential for your growth and the team's efficiency.",
  "To ensure they're productive, always have a clear agenda and stick to it.",
  "Keep the discussions focused and on-track.",
  "It's important to be proactive in these situations.",
  "If you feel the meeting is derailing, gently steer the discussion back on course.",
  "It's a skill to learn when to intervene and when to let the discussion flow.",
  "Also, keep in mind that not every discussion requires a meeting.",
  "Sometimes, a quick chat or an email exchange can resolve an issue.",
  "Keep in mind that time management is also about knowing your limits.",
  "Don't overload yourself with tasks.",
  "If you feel a task is too large, break it down into manageable chunks."
 ],
